[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30100300_01_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30100300_01_0010","text":"久等了／真乃！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30100300_01_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30100300_01_0020","text":"灯织，巡\n欢迎回来"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30100300_01_0030","text":"原来你们在绘本区啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30100300_01_0040","text":"嗯……啊，抱歉……\n是不是让你们找我了……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30100300_01_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30100300_01_0050","text":"没有没有，只是有种感觉\n觉得真乃可能会在这里！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30100300_01_0060","text":"这样啊……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30100300_01_0061","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30100300_01_0070","text":"色彩缤纷的，贴着各种各样的画……\n感觉像是从书店来到了另一个世界一样……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30100300_01_0080","text":"有温暖的气息，还有兴奋的感觉……\n也许让人觉得很舒服……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30100300_01_0081","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30100300_01_0090","text":"嗯，我懂\n感觉流淌着温柔的时光"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30100300_01_0100","text":"嗯嗯！那我要提个建议……\n再在这里待一会儿怎么样？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30100300_01_0101","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30100300_01_0102","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30100300_01_0103","text":"Motion"}]
